WEBVTT

1
00:00:05,390 --> 00:00:07,590
What are you going to do to take a shower?

2
00:00:08,410 --> 00:00:09,690
Really go take a shower

3
00:00:10,010 --> 00:00:11,450
Why don't you turn on the light when you go take a shower?

4
00:00:11,450 --> 00:00:13,050
Why are you so sneaky?

5
00:00:14,050 --> 00:00:16,170
Afraid of disturbing your sleep, you locked the door

6
00:00:16,170 --> 00:00:17,770
There's no way I can go in and sleep peacefully.

7
00:00:18,330 --> 00:00:23,470
He's a joke. I'm a bastard. Just wait for me.

8
00:00:29,720 --> 00:00:37,890
It's almost eight o'clock

9
00:00:38,090 --> 00:00:39,090
I usually wake up at seven o'clock

10
00:00:39,490 --> 00:00:42,870
so many injuries

11
00:00:43,470 --> 00:00:48,670
Zhang Yuhan, what are you thinking about? I brought you a breakfast

12
00:00:49,190 --> 00:00:51,190
What have you been eating?

13
00:00:51,190 --> 00:00:52,270
Are these edible?

14
00:00:52,470 --> 00:00:53,390
no nutrition

15
00:00:53,390 --> 00:01:04,140
And it's not clean or hygienic. Where have you been so early in the morning?

16
00:01:04,460 --> 00:01:05,460
I went out and practiced for an hour

17
00:01:06,740 --> 00:01:15,420
If you want to drink milk and heat it yourself, you don’t need to eat it, and you don’t care about these things.

18
00:01:15,420 --> 00:01:18,220
The Chinese have been eating it for thousands of years and it’s pretty good. No one has died from eating it.

19
00:01:18,460 --> 00:01:19,700
You are always hiding

20
00:01:20,630 --> 00:01:27,230
Are you trying to teach me a lesson? I'll go to the car and wait for you in the car after eating.

21
00:01:32,180 --> 00:01:33,700
A bodyguard is here to teach me a lesson

22
00:01:34,220 --> 00:01:35,460
What's wrong with drinking milk and eating bread?
